0..76 Comment "//! The identity subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by"
77..154 Comment "//! every source that reads them (`import \"./circle-base.gandr\";`): the empty"
155..226 Comment "//! type, the circle, the presented integers and the free naturals, the"
227..306 Comment "//! winding number and spinning with their round trips (the book\'s § 8.1), and"
307..385 Comment "//! the maps out of the circle the circle sources state their laws over, after"
386..459 Comment "//! cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/HITs/S1/Base.agda`. `circle.gandr` states the"
460..533 Comment "//! equivalence `winding` the round trips make and what it computes; this"
534..578 Comment "//! source states only what the others read."
