2373..2447 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop (cubical\'s `decodeEncode` at the"
2448..2522 Comment "/// point): the round trip at a variable, by induction over the words. The"
2523..2601 Comment "/// result type reads the word the fold descends on, so each arm answers it at"
2602..2673 Comment "/// its letter and the recursive call at the rest: `sect[<](q)` relates"
2674..2749 Comment "/// `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷"
2750..2830 Comment "/// spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))` runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The"
2831..2907 Comment "/// case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the arms"
2908..2984 Comment "/// compose to `cong(loopOn, cong(unloopOn, p))`, whose functions compose to"
2985..3057 Comment "/// the identity under the words\' rules, so the chain is `p` itself, the"
3058..3076 Comment "/// answer at `q`."
